      "ArticleTitle": "Comparative study of long-term effects of Molsidomin 8 mg (slow release form) and ISDN 40 mg (slow release form) on angina pectoris and ischaemic ST-segment depression during maximal bicycle-ergometry in patients with coronary insufficiency.",
